OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI to support gardai amid huge
OL,4,Asecurity operation for EU meetings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) will support their Irish
OL,8,Fcounterparts in policing a major
OL,9,FEuropean Union (EU) summit in Dublin
OL,10,Fthis week.
OL,12,FEven though officers from abroad will
OL,13,Fnot be involved in frontline policing,
OL,14,Fgardai (Irish police) said they are
OL,15,Fbeing supported by the PSNI, police
OL,16,Ffrom Latvia and Portugal and other
OL,17,Finternational law enforcement agencies.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
