OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI to support gardai amid huge
OL,4,Asecurity operation for EU meetings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolicing the European Political
OL,7,FCommunity (EPC) summit on Thursday and
OL,8,Fthe informal meeting of the European
OL,9,FCouncil on Friday will be the single
OL,10,Fbiggest policing and security operation
OL,11,Fin the history of the republic.
OL,13,FIt comes as a number of hoax bomb
OL,14,Fthreats have been made, with more
OL,15,Fexpected in the coming days.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
